Wow,

300
00:16:16,500 --> 00:16:18,160
splendid!

301
00:16:18,160 --> 00:16:19,260
Haa

302
00:16:19,260 --> 00:16:20,380
This is exhausting.

303
00:16:21,180 --> 00:16:22,540
Wonderful!

304
00:16:22,540 --> 00:16:23,720
Wonderful!

305
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:24,680
Fore!

306
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:24,860
Fore!

307
00:16:24,860 --> 00:16:24,920
Fore!

308
00:16:24,920 --> 00:16:25,160
Fore!

309
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:25,780
Fore!

310
00:16:25,780 --> 00:16:27,220
Fwoosh

311
00:16:27,220 --> 00:16:27,260
Fwoosh

312
00:16:27,260 --> 00:16:27,480
Fwoosh

313
00:16:27,480 --> 00:16:27,500
Fwoosh

314
00:16:27,500 --> 00:16:28,640
Fwoosh

315
00:16:28,640 --> 00:16:36,880
Fwoosh

316
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,460
Yeah!

317
00:16:40,460 --> 00:16:44,620
Nice!

318
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:54,560
Gramps

319
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:55,740
Grappler!

320
00:17:00,580 --> 00:17:02,060
Gramps

321
00:17:03,800 --> 00:17:06,700
Behold, this is the Water Jutsu!

322
00:17:06,700 --> 00:17:07,520
Wow!

323
00:17:41,500 --> 00:17:58,440
Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes,
yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes...

324
00:17:58,880 --> 00:18:00,860
Ninjas are nothing but
child's play after all.

325
00:18:01,520 --> 00:18:04,460
What did you say?
Are you trying to insult Japan's traditions?

326
00:18:04,520 --> 00:18:07,680
Papa, that's rude to Darling's grandpa!

327
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:08,900
It's not rude at all!

328
00:18:08,900 --> 00:18:13,000
Against the military's latest weapons,
ninjas are no better than babies.

329
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:14,800
Shut up, you bearded gorilla!

330
00:18:14,800 --> 00:18:16,360
What did you call me, you old geezer?

331
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:18,620
Hey, if you mock my master,
I won't forgive you!

332
00:18:18,980 --> 00:18:20,640
Grandpa, please stop!

333
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:24,760
This gentleman is my former commanding officer and Jodie's father,
you know!

334
00:18:24,760 --> 00:18:27,740
Shut up! How can I stay silent
when someone mocks ninjas?

335
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:56,760
Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeh!

336
00:18:56,760 --> 00:19:01,380
Why you! You're really going to make me angry!
I'll show you what happens!

337
00:19:05,620 --> 00:19:07,240
Wait, where did he vanish to?

338
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:13,580
There!

339
00:19:17,560 --> 00:19:18,480
Busted!

340
00:19:19,180 --> 00:19:20,060
Lord Ryo!

341
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:21,060
Senpai!

342
00:19:26,760 --> 00:19:28,140
Why, you insolent little...!

343
00:19:28,420 --> 00:19:29,640
Come on!

344
00:19:34,900 --> 00:19:36,940
Hahaha, shut up!

345
00:19:37,060 --> 00:19:37,760
M-Master!

346
00:19:42,460 --> 00:19:44,700
Grenades are nothing to me!

347
00:19:49,820 --> 00:19:52,000
Damn you, Yaru-san!

348
00:19:52,980 --> 00:19:54,280
Come on, hit me hard!

349
00:19:54,380 --> 00:19:55,260
I'll lend a hand!

350
00:19:56,760 --> 00:19:58,540
I can't use ninjutsu yet!

351
00:19:58,780 --> 00:20:02,380
You're supposed to become my successor and inherit my six thousand tsubo of land,
aren't you!

352
00:20:02,560 --> 00:20:04,000
Y-yes! Understood!

353
00:20:06,420 --> 00:20:07,700
Grenade, take this!

354
00:20:08,960 --> 00:20:09,560
Stop it!

355
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:10,560
That hurts!

356
00:20:21,260 --> 00:20:21,980
How about that?

357
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:28,980
Damn you! I won't let you have it!

358
00:20:38,640 --> 00:20:40,215
Damn it,

359
00:20:40,265 --> 00:20:42,382
The switch!

360
00:20:42,432 --> 00:20:44,600
Ryotsu!

361
00:20:44,600 --> 00:20:44,940
Yes!

362
00:20:45,480 --> 00:20:48,140
Those good-for-nothing slackers!
If it's come to this,

363
00:20:48,140 --> 00:20:49,840
Hey, hey, whoosh!

364
00:20:49,840 --> 00:20:50,880
Take this!

365
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:59,560
Alright, we'll stop the missile.

366
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:01,060
But how?

367
00:21:01,900 --> 00:21:02,680
We did it!

368
00:21:03,120 --> 00:21:05,560
Here you go, Mr. Horse of Fortune.

369
00:21:07,580 --> 00:21:09,740
We're going to change
the missile's direction.

370
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:10,400
What?

371
00:21:11,600 --> 00:21:13,760
This one? Like this?

372
00:21:16,740 --> 00:21:17,880
Yes, nice.

373
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:21,580
Hey, don't come back!

374
00:21:21,700 --> 00:21:22,940
Easier said than done.

375
00:21:23,380 --> 00:21:26,060
I'll give you my
8,000-tsubo plot in America.

376
00:21:26,060 --> 00:21:27,160
So don't come over.

377
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:28,740
What, 8,000 tsubo?

378
00:21:28,740 --> 00:21:29,600
Alright!

379
00:21:31,140 --> 00:21:31,860
Whoa!

380
00:21:33,220 --> 00:21:33,940
What?

381
00:21:34,760 --> 00:21:36,160
Are you betraying the master?

382
00:21:36,160 --> 00:21:37,720
They're offering 8,000 tsubo.

383
00:21:38,160 --> 00:21:39,860
I'll give you Urayama's 5,000 tsubo.

384
00:21:40,220 --> 00:21:41,080
Alright!

385
00:21:43,800 --> 00:21:45,700
Throw in a villa in Hawaii too.

386
00:21:45,700 --> 00:21:46,080
Yosh!

387
00:21:46,620 --> 00:21:48,200
How about a condo building this year?

388
00:21:48,200 --> 00:21:48,660
Yosh!

389
00:21:48,660 --> 00:21:49,660
Aaaah!

390
00:21:49,660 --> 00:21:51,360
This is like a kids' fight.

391
00:21:51,360 --> 00:21:51,720
Yosh!

392
00:21:53,940 --> 00:21:54,960
Yahoo!

393
00:21:54,980 --> 00:21:56,160
Impact, burst!

394
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:57,220
Go on, do it!

395
00:21:57,600 --> 00:21:58,160
What?

396
00:21:58,800 --> 00:21:59,860
What?

397
00:22:06,520 --> 00:22:08,140
I-I'll bring this one over!

398
00:22:11,060 --> 00:22:11,840
It's an island!

399
00:22:24,060 --> 00:22:25,160
Oh my gaaad!

400
00:22:25,260 --> 00:22:26,220
Jinmotsu

401
00:22:31,920 --> 00:22:32,580
Whoa!

402
00:22:33,980 --> 00:22:35,280
It sank, you know!

403
00:22:36,380 --> 00:22:37,980
What are we gonna do, old man!

404
00:22:38,280 --> 00:22:39,680
It's not my fault!

405
00:22:39,780 --> 00:22:41,700
It was that guy who fired the missile!

406
00:22:41,900 --> 00:22:42,580
Old man!

407
00:22:43,140 --> 00:22:44,100
Whoa, no way!

408
00:22:44,300 --> 00:22:45,580
Time for practice!

409
00:22:45,800 --> 00:22:46,420
You old geezer!

410
00:22:46,600 --> 00:22:48,960
I'll let you off the hook for today!

411
00:22:49,080 --> 00:22:49,820
Farewell!

412
00:22:50,020 --> 00:22:50,480
There!

413
00:22:50,800 --> 00:22:51,620
Don't run away!

414
00:22:53,160 --> 00:22:57,080
The Katawarai Corps has run out of enemies to fight,
so it's nothing but a joke now.

415
00:22:57,460 --> 00:22:57,820
Here it goes!

416
00:23:00,680 --> 00:23:02,280
Ninja Art: Giant Cauldron!

417
00:23:02,280 --> 00:23:06,180
Here goes!

418
00:23:06,180 --> 00:23:07,440
Hey, wait a second!

419
00:23:08,040 --> 00:23:09,980
What about the Rokusetsubō land, then?

420
00:23:11,120 --> 00:23:13,880
How can I trust someone
who keeps betraying people?

421
00:23:13,880 --> 00:23:15,820
I'm not making you my disciple anymore.

422
00:23:16,860 --> 00:23:19,260
Don't kid around! Hey, get back here!

423
00:23:20,020 --> 00:23:20,740
Stop!

424
00:23:23,620 --> 00:23:24,500
It's sunk now!

425
00:23:24,680 --> 00:23:25,560
Missile!

426
00:23:26,120 --> 00:23:26,920
That's right! That's right!

427
00:23:27,200 --> 00:23:28,740
What? You've got to be kidding!

428
00:23:29,360 --> 00:23:30,000
Wait!

429
00:23:39,180 --> 00:23:40,780
Why does it have to be me?!

430
00:23:44,800 --> 00:23:45,540
Ryo-sama!

431
00:23:46,340 --> 00:23:47,140
Senpai!

432
00:23:47,820 --> 00:23:50,140
Sorry, this is all because of my grandpa.

433
00:23:50,140 --> 00:23:52,460
No, it's Daddy's fault.

434
00:23:53,620 --> 00:23:56,625
Help me! I can't stand ninjas anymore!

435
00:23:56,675 --> 00:23:59,120
Dowai! I hate it! Dowaaai!

436
00:24:04,440 --> 00:24:07,331
You, Tetsuo Ishizu,
the traffic safety instructor,

437
00:24:07,381 --> 00:24:10,140
traffic safety has bullets and cannonballs too,
you know!

438
00:24:10,420 --> 00:24:12,700
And what's with that getup,
looking like an armored samurai?!

439
00:24:13,020 --> 00:24:15,135
No matter how much you
call it a traffic war,

440
00:24:15,185 --> 00:24:17,640
it's not the same as a battle
from the Sengoku period!

441
00:24:18,120 --> 00:24:21,420
Next time, the traffic safety demon,
see you then!

442
00:24:35,360 --> 00:24:44,040
Surprise and commotion,
timing and solving, quick and helping out

443
00:24:44,040 --> 00:24:45,720
Prediction

444
00:24:46,480 --> 00:24:49,800
Decided with a dun-dun,
and a flash of inspiration

445
00:24:49,800 --> 00:24:52,760
Yah, bouncing along,
demedeme, all brought together

446
00:24:52,760 --> 00:24:55,700
Magi-magi, taking action, flying onward

447
00:24:56,620 --> 00:25:00,420
Above all, the pure, good power

448
00:25:00,420 --> 00:25:02,780
Gather everyone

449
00:25:03,820 --> 00:25:06,360
If you come here

450
00:25:07,320 --> 00:25:09,460
Like a dream

451
00:25:09,460 --> 00:25:12,640
The final energy

452
00:25:14,060 --> 00:25:20,040
Gazing at tomorrow, believing in yesterday,
painting the universe, standing on the earth

453
00:25:20,040 --> 00:25:23,760
The star of Kameari is coming, so

454
00:25:26,100 --> 00:25:27,480
This should be fine, right?

455
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:28,980
Like hell it is!

